{"version":1,"content":"<p>江嘉敏及葉振弘（Marco）於HOY處境劇《你的保安 李寶安》劇演一對，Marco表示和江嘉敏演對手戲很開心，江嘉敏笑言以往演戲多爭家產，今次有場主動的親密戲，不小心撞向對手的重要部位，問Marco痛不痛？</p><p>「過咗去唔記得咗！</p><p>但我好堅強沒有受傷。</p><p>」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T14:01:50.147045+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T12:05:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:37:37.875112+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T13:57:43.177626+00:00","content_hash":"59af6f1388b798a41ba587dde1ba98e59af19eb50d4a1b701e0422ff22d71fc6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}